 "text": "Pierce County, North Dakota - Departments\nSkip to main content\nHome\nAbout Us\nCommission\nDepartments\nBoards\nEvents\nEmployment\nDownloads\nLinks\nFAQs\nContact\nHome » Departments »\nQuick Links\nHome\nEmployment\nCounty Recorder\nEmergency Management\nState's Attorney\nCommission\nPhysical Address:\n240 2nd St SE, Suite 6\nRugby, North Dakota 58368\nMailing Address:\n,\n(701)776-5225 (701)776-6942\nThe board of commissioners consists of 5 members which are elected by districts and are staggered for a four year term. The commissioners make policies that regulate the functions of all the departments and see to it that they are followed. They are responsible for the county budget, social service administration, county road department and many other county concerns. Commissioners serve on a variety of boards and committees.\nMeeting Information\nPierce County Commission meetings are held on the 1st Tuesday of every month.\nPIERCE COUNTY PUBLIC COMMENT POLICY\nContacts\nName\nPosition\nPhone\nEmail\nDavid Migler\nDistrict #5\n(701)776-2223 ext.\ncindymigler56@gmail.com\nTerry Hoffert\nDistrict #4\n(701)776-2152 ext.\nhoffertterry@gmail.com\nJoel Berg\nDistrict #2\n(701)771-8133 ext.\njrberg90@gmail.com\nDavid Bednarz\nDistrict #3\n701-681-9683 ext.\ndavidbednarz@gmail.com\nJoe Bohl\nDistrict #1\n(701)583-2288 ext.\ngojoe826@gmail.com\nNews\nShow more...\n-->\nEvents\nShow more...\nJobs\nShow more...\nDownloads\nOct. 6, 2026 Agenda\nSept.1, 2026 Agenda\nJuly 2026 minutes/June 2026 Expenditures\nAugust 12, 2026 Agenda\nAugust 4, 2026 Agenda\nJune 2026 minutes/May 2026 Expenditures\nAugust 10, 2026 Agenda\nJuly 21, 2026 Agenda\nJuly 7, 2026 Agenda\nPublic Comment Policy\nShow More\nLinks\nFAQ\nPrev Next\nPierce County\n240 2nd St SE\nRugby, ND 58368-1830\nHome\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nLogin\nPrivacy Policy\nDisclaimer\nAccessibility\n© Pierce County, ND. All right reserved.\nToggle navigation\nHome\nAbout Us\nCommission\nDepartments\nBoards\nEvents\nEmployment\nDownloads\nLinks\nFAQs\nContact\nThis site uses cookies to improve the user experience. By using our site, you agree to our use of cookies. Cookie Policy\nAccept",
